  <info>
    <name>HUD Tweaks - Fixes</name>
    <modid>HUDTweaksFixes</modid>
    <description>Fixes and compatibility backports for HUDTweaks v4: reliable prompt dismissal, idle fading while injured, and robust player detection through loading and possession changes. Slower activity and layout checks reduce recurring work while preserving the upstream HUD layout and fade animation.</description>
